<title>USA: Ameron wins two orders worth $45 million.</title>
<headline>Ameron wins two orders worth $45 million.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameron International Corp on Tuesday said its concrete and steel pipe business has won   two</p>
<p>major pipeline orders in California worth over $45 million.</p>
<p>The first is the Rancho Penasquitos Pipeline in San Diego County, worth $25 million, and the Arrowhead East Tunnel in San Bernardino County, worth $20 million.</p>
</text>
